{"5081800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flash The Floppy Fish", "steam_appid": 5081800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flash The Floppy Fish is a ragdoll physics-based speed running game about learning to master deep floppy fish mechanics and shaving down your time to beat yours and your friends' times. Play as Finn, a failed ocean racer and underdog, who has yet again determined to become the best at racing, but this time on land. Will you help Finn win his races and become the Beach's next Flash? Help him become... Flash The Floppy Fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of fast flopping to finish fast and rank up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.mp4?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse levels your way! Think you can find a faster path? PROVE IT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.mp4?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to some fishy figures. Many may be your competition, but some may be rooting for you! Either way, they have alot to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/3b4088c3c2211fe681761204e3ec65bb.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/3b4088c3c2211fe681761204e3ec65bb.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/3b4088c3c2211fe681761204e3ec65bb.mp4?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flash The Floppy Fish is a ragdoll physics-based speed running game about learning to master deep floppy fish mechanics and shaving down your time to beat yours and your friends' times. Play as Finn, a failed ocean racer and underdog, who has yet again determined to become the best at racing, but this time on land. Will you help Finn win his races and become the Beach's next Flash? Help him become... Flash The Floppy Fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of fast flopping to finish fast and rank up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/0b56641d838a16acd8a62667948db853.mp4?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse levels your way! Think you can find a faster path? PROVE IT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/ede1c58733fdcd41094c201c96f368a2.mp4?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to some fishy figures. Many may be your competition, but some may be rooting for you! Either way, they have alot to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/3b4088c3c2211fe681761204e3ec65bb.poster.avif?t=1786821553\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5081800/extras/3b4088c3c2211fe681761204e3ec65bb.webm?t=1786821553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea